  triage:occursIn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/AY4/edb2ed877> ;
  triage:note "quality-mgr qa-pr1279-r3 close-out (final task's original dispatched fork was lost to a host disk-full outage 2026-09-07 through 2026-09-11; closed directly by quality-mgr on resumption). Confirmed at PR #1279 head edb2ed877: notify_gate field, block_next_notify() (lib.rs:734), and the reworked notify() (lib.rs:878-892) now honor the gate the same way prompt_gate/list_gate already did, closing the A2/L12 stall-injection gap. Live CI confirmed green at this exact head: gh run 34086314808, all three Test-matrix legs (ubuntu/macos/windows) pass, headSha matches PR #1279 exactly." .

